cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TMPA or this research repository, please cite the relevant publication and the V1.0 publication set below."
title: "TMPA / joinwell52 Research Repository"
type: software
abstract: >-
  TMPA (Textual Multi-Agent Process Architecture) is an engineering-driven
  research and specification repository for durable AI-agent governance. It
  defines inspectable responsibility, lifecycle, authority, conflict,
  conformance, and evidence semantics for long-running work performed by AI
  agents and humans, and publishes the associated reference materials and
  implementation evidence.
